  "name": "Knight of the Sacred Word",
  "type": "subclass",
  "img": "modules/grimnir-lyonesse/assets/icons/lorc-mailed-fist.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a Knight of the Sacred Word, an ascetic warrior sworn to defend the College of the Voice. You reject armor and worldly titles, relying instead on speed, discipline, and the perfection of body and voice. You serve no crown. Your duty is to protect the Voices and their teachings wherever they are threatened. Knights of the Sacred Word are not bound to kingdoms. When rulers defy the Maker’s law or seek to silence the College, the Order acts without hesitation. Through relentless training, you have learned to shape your body and voice into a unified force. Your words carry power.</p>"
    },
